#! console --size 120x34
# An empty chat and an empty notebook show a centred start screen: the keys that start work and the
# sessions to go back to, each a click target.
wait-frame 15000 command palette
key alt-n
wait-frame 10000 untitled
wait-frame 5000 ask below, or start with
snap chat
key alt-shift-j
wait-frame 5000 no kernel cells yet
snap notebook
quit
